What:		/proc/jank_info/cpu_jank_info/cpu_info
What:		/proc/jank_info/cpu_jank_info/cpu_info_sig
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only OnePlus Android 14 composite CPU telemetry. cpu_info
		reports the 64-window history and cpu_info_sig reports one window.
		Busy ratio, cgroup ratio, frequency, transition and online-mask
		fields use live accounting. The final three hot-thread fields keep
		the donor grammar but report '-' until the separate task-tracking
		producer is ported and validated.

